# ── jpeg → jpg canonical redirects (301) ──────────────────────────────────
# jpeg is an alias for jpg. Both trailing-slash and non-trailing-slash forms
# are redirected so neither the flat file nor the directory file is served
# directly with a mismatched canonical.
# _redirects rules take priority over static files in Cloudflare Pages.

/jpeg           /jpg/           301
/jpeg/          /jpg/           301
/jpeg-to-png    /jpg-to-png/    301
/jpeg-to-png/   /jpg-to-png/    301
/jpeg-to-webp   /jpg-to-webp/   301
/jpeg-to-webp/  /jpg-to-webp/   301
