/jpeg-to-gif/   /jpg-to-gif/    301
/jpeg-to-bmp    /jpg-to-bmp/    301
/jpeg-to-bmp/   /jpg-to-bmp/    301
/jpeg-to-avif   /jpg-to-avif/   301
/jpeg-to-avif/  /jpg-to-avif/   301
/jpeg-to-tiff   /jpg-to-tiff/   301
